# ── Agent one-shot debris (NOT needed for cargo test / run) ─────────────
# Keep in git: crates/**/src/**/*.rs and Cargo.toml. No crate build.rs wirers.
# Archive is `_wire_archive/` (gitignored). Do not re-hook them from cargo.
**/_patch_*.py
**/_apply_*.py
**/_fix_*.py
**/_run_*.py
**/_run_*.ps1
**/_inject_*.py
**/_strip_*.py
**/_wire_*.py
**/_finalize_*.py
