# ── Docs: keep product/port markdown; ignore agent doc-patch harness ─────
# Tracked intentionally: docs/**/*.md, docs/**/*.html (port kit, architecture).
# Root monorepo only ignores /docs/ (Haxe), not openlife/RustServer/docs/.
docs/port/_*.py
docs/port/_*.ps1
docs/port/_*.txt
docs/port/_*.bat
docs/port/_*.cmd
docs/port/_apply_*.py
docs/port/_patch_*.py
docs/port/_run_*.py
docs/port/_run_*.ps1
docs/port/_fix_*.py
docs/port/_update_*.py
docs/port/apply_*.py
docs/port/patch_*.py
docs/port/_doc_snip*
docs/port/_fm_*.txt
docs/port/_mute_*.txt
docs/port/_todo_*.txt
# Underscore-prefixed agent scratch under port kit (canonical docs have no leading _)
docs/port/_*.md
docs/port/*_ADDENDUM.md
# Transient CALL_INDEX insert fragments (canonical CALL_INDEX.md is tracked)
docs/port/CALL_INDEX_*_INSERT.md
docs/port/CALL_INDEX_*_snip.md
docs/port/*_snip.md
